# =============================================================================
# BloodLink AI — Client Environment Configuration Template
# =============================================================================
# Copy to client/.env for custom local settings.
# For Vercel deployments, add to Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables.

# Production Backend API URL:
# - Scenario 1: All-in-One Vercel Deployment (Frontend + Serverless API on same domain):
#   Leave VITE_API_URL empty/omitted. The client automatically uses relative '/api',
#   which routes to Vercel Serverless Functions with zero CORS issues.
#
# - Scenario 2: Decoupled Deployment (Frontend on Vercel + Backend on Render/Railway/VPS):
#   Set VITE_API_URL to your deployed backend URL including the /api path:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://bloodlink-api.onrender.com/api
#
# - Scenario 3: Local Development:
#   Leave omitted. Vite proxy automatically routes '/api' to http://localhost:5002.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-production-backend.com/api
